test.yaml:10:23: "cancel-in-progress" is enabled here (job "publish" runs "cargo publish" and the workflow runs for pushes of tags), so a new run cancels a release or deployment which is still running and can leave it half done. set "cancel-in-progress: false" to let the running one finish first [concurrency-cancels-release]
test.yaml:23:27: "cancel-in-progress" is enabled here (job "docs" uses the environment "github-pages" and the workflow runs for pushes to "main"), so a new run cancels a release or deployment which is still running and can leave it half done. set "cancel-in-progress: false" to let the running one finish first [concurrency-cancels-release]
